{
"file": 36,
"paths": [
"d002/f651"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "69326600",
"en_raw": "...A friend of Shiina's in the park?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "6677278a",
"en_raw": "Yeah"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "cfbb0f7f",
"en_raw": "They say he just moved in"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "0661c267",
"en_raw": "From where?"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "bd59eac3",
"en_raw": "Um, well, uh..."
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "64be061d",
"en_raw": "Outer space?"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "cab31535",
"en_raw": "The Toilet Gang said that, right?"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "0590e15b",
"en_raw": "That really ticks me off..."
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "257ac869",
"en_raw": "What are you talking about?"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "345c77df",
"en_raw": "In the park under the overpass, a so-called..."
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "2bada941",
"en_raw": "funky person"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "511ae994",
"en_raw": "has apparently settled in"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "08d13373",
"en_raw": "There's a girl in my class"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "63af4fbd",
"en_raw": "named Sakai"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "d31430e7",
"en_raw": "and she teased Shiina"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "9adf83b6",
"en_raw": "saying the park's resident"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "d1cf179b",
"en_raw": "is Shiina's friend"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "87006990",
"en_raw": "That's awful"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "76537f54",
"en_raw": "...Why?"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "c6e6864d",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wants to meet her friend!"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "634289ab",
"en_raw": "Don't, it's dangerous, in many ways"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "a7d72eb0",
"en_raw": "No, Kurumi's going to meet him!"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "8d2021b5",
"en_raw": "The park under the overpass"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "147fa9db",
"en_raw": "is the one on the slope from the station, right?"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "062458d6",
"en_raw": "Hey, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "0722d1e7",
"en_raw": "You're really going to meet him?"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "b133a6c1",
"en_raw": "Yeah! Kurumi's going!"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "b016c384",
"en_raw": "...Someone definitely lives here"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "fb75be5c",
"en_raw": "it looked like, but..."
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "1e79d044",
"en_raw": "Not much use if he isn't here"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "9f654048",
"en_raw": "Hey hey"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "c6e6864d",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wants to meet her friend!"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "fb8da4b5",
"en_raw": "He's not here, so it can't be helped"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "328bb968",
"en_raw": "Then shall we try again tomorrow?"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "b016c384",
"en_raw": "...Someone definitely lives here"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "b362e70e",
"en_raw": "It looked like it, but"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "eb1f9f17",
"en_raw": "not much use if he isn't here"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "7b6ebce1",
"en_raw": "Hey hey, Sango"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "f6da1682",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wants to meet him!"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "3e788833",
"en_raw": "...Then, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "e80dc3c9",
"en_raw": "you go first"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "9fcecfda",
"en_raw": "I'm going to"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "19c2e661",
"en_raw": "pass on that smell"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "5b8b665f",
"en_raw": "A friend in the park~"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "f7fb82e3",
"en_raw": "...You always seem"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "93e97e70",
"en_raw": "to be having fun, that's nice"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "6f7e1bdb",
"en_raw": "Somehow... more than I expected..."
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "068a13d5",
"en_raw": "the conversation was"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "8398c850",
"en_raw": "logical"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "3fd79994",
"en_raw": "Do you think so?"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "c75a48fc",
"en_raw": "To me it was a bit..."
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "4b15ada8",
"en_raw": "I sensed some single story"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "1fc1c4cc",
"en_raw": "running underneath it all"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "92f502a1",
"en_raw": "...Though something"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "06efea3d",
"en_raw": "is definitely off"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "7b6ebce1",
"en_raw": "Hey hey, Sango"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "b7f6e777",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wants to talk to him too!"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "f956fb48",
"en_raw": "Oh, right"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "4c1e64c9",
"en_raw": "Shiina and that old guy"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "ca71f005",
"en_raw": "could probably talk naturally"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "8e8deb73",
"en_raw": "You should try talking once"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "5b8b665f",
"en_raw": "A friend in the park~"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "32001685",
"en_raw": "Don't turn everything into a song"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "e6bfb9b8",
"en_raw": "Shiina"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "ad34a3b4",
"en_raw": "Kurumi doesn't like"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "898c9d39",
"en_raw": "that old guy"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "71c24fd1",
"en_raw": "I was just taking a walk"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "45441295",
"en_raw": "and he said go home"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "66598ab5",
"en_raw": "Isn't that a bit dangerous?"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "1d6c3531",
"en_raw": "He was recognizing Shiina"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "2ef34719",
"en_raw": "in a total fantasy world"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "e4d3100b",
"en_raw": "Hey, Sango"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "7433cebe",
"en_raw": "Let's explain it properly to him"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "2978c447",
"en_raw": "That Shiina isn't a Princess Bon"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "8da5f160",
"en_raw": "or anything like that"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "9c19c203",
"en_raw": "I think it's the 'let sleeping"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "40af03fe",
"en_raw": "gods lie' type of situation"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "d8a09bb0",
"en_raw": "I think that man too"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "a064e507",
"en_raw": "would understand"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "90705f79",
"en_raw": "if we explain it properly"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "fca31625",
"en_raw": "And so, another daily visit to the park..."
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "f713b168",
"en_raw": "We shouldn't have"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "a48611e1",
"en_raw": "gone near him after all"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "721c4334",
"en_raw": "What are you saying now?"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "0f44f108",
"en_raw": "More importantly, Takadai Street"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "0dcddb8e",
"en_raw": "Hey Shiina, you might see a UFO"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "5a3ddca0",
"en_raw": "How carefree!"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "735336d9",
"en_raw": "It'll be fine, those types"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "68337a6b",
"en_raw": "can't do anything"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "4f5b79cb",
"en_raw": "as long as we have Melos"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "8a787c82",
"en_raw": "Besides, do you think it'll come?"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "de548ef8",
"en_raw": "The Kaplas rescue boat"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "a7ae296d",
"en_raw": "But he's an adult, no telling what he'll do"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "50600838",
"en_raw": "True"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "a1882a27",
"en_raw": "So after we've seen everything"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "e6de0982",
"en_raw": "let's go to the police"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "7760f005",
"en_raw": "Helping prevent crime"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "82b9ba81",
"en_raw": "is a citizen's duty"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "5de0bdf7",
"en_raw": "Takadai Street is"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "f9b37e94",
"en_raw": "up the stairs"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "c482e279",
"en_raw": "that spot with the gorgeous"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "05389b97",
"en_raw": "night view, right?"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "c6addca7",
"en_raw": "The view is good"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "3600482d",
"en_raw": "so it's perfect"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "ee61554e",
"en_raw": "for contacting a UFO, isn't it?"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "c27f4b3a",
"en_raw": "That man"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "2f454df9",
"en_raw": "thought he was an alien to the very end"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "712bf9a6",
"en_raw": "I felt such a strong will"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "aeca8062",
"en_raw": "Totally wrong, though"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "ba83b543",
"en_raw": "What do we do, Sango?"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "ff878416",
"en_raw": "The police after all..."
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "57b1349d",
"en_raw": "You have no intention"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "bde9ada7",
"en_raw": "of going, do you?"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "30c8d4b7",
"en_raw": "...Good"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "a5f06a1f",
"en_raw": "Hey hey, Nao, did you hear?"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "a2c42893",
"en_raw": "The old man said his tummy goes grumble!"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "8ad6caed",
"en_raw": "Kurumi is hungry too!"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "8e8b4b0d",
"en_raw": "Shiina's friend, huh..."
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "4d342543",
"en_raw": "It's apt, in a way"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "4d041bc0",
"en_raw": "What does that phrase mean?"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "eff563f3",
"en_raw": "Well, um"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "f9d9436d",
"en_raw": "Anyway, you use it"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "9394fdc7",
"en_raw": "in times like this"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "c27f4b3a",
"en_raw": "That man"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "2f454df9",
"en_raw": "thought he was an alien to the very end"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "712bf9a6",
"en_raw": "I felt such a strong will"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "aeca8062",
"en_raw": "Totally wrong, though"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "ba83b543",
"en_raw": "What do we do, Sango?"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "ff878416",
"en_raw": "The police after all..."
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "462ed249",
"en_raw": "...No need to go"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "2addd26c",
"en_raw": "Honestly"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "7cb57183",
"en_raw": "But if Shiina gets"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "181fd5d8",
"en_raw": "followed again..."
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "53cdb6ab",
"en_raw": "...I don't think telling him"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "8d9fe1ef",
"en_raw": "would fix anything"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "25498844",
"en_raw": "But it's better than doing nothing"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "882c1584",
"en_raw": "Is he still at that spot in the park?"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "aff285dd",
"en_raw": "It's sheltered from the rain, there's water"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "7549af94",
"en_raw": "It's a good place"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "e5d689b0",
"en_raw": "for someone like him to live"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "6b9799e0",
"en_raw": "He probably hasn't moved"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "ed3ec9bd",
"en_raw": "I think it's pointless to tell him..."
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "e4109728",
"en_raw": "But it's better than not saying"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "b9abcd61",
"en_raw": "...He doesn't seem like a bad person"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "b4aabcc6",
"en_raw": "Well, basically"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "f2672edb",
"en_raw": "Nao just wants closure"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "cce0df4a",
"en_raw": "Fine, I'll go"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "2aa09549",
"en_raw": "The park under the overpass or anywhere"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "7cc10b60",
"en_raw": "Aww, the old man"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "160f5724",
"en_raw": "is gone"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "52777ff6",
"en_raw": "Too bad, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "e784d2eb",
"en_raw": "You two got along so well"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "1c2585bc",
"en_raw": "Don't put it that way"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "cc6d0834",
"en_raw": "Sorry, sorry"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "196f7036",
"en_raw": "But really"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "c8d8b140",
"en_raw": "he wasn't a bad guy"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "f20fb697",
"en_raw": "Not the lying adult type"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "2a12f3d9",
"en_raw": "right?"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "20bd6b03",
"en_raw": "He was quite strange, though"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "14d2881f",
"en_raw": "How should I put it"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "61a5e5a6",
"en_raw": "Yeah, how should I put it"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "b785f817",
"en_raw": "How to put it?"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "42a3b258",
"en_raw": "...A good person?"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "629e34fa",
"en_raw": "........."
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "b4134480",
"en_raw": "Breaking down is scary, I think, but..."
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "67b1212e",
"en_raw": "getting used to it"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "a2bb5951",
"en_raw": "might actually be scarier"
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "543c3ba5",
"en_raw": "...Sango sometimes"
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "41405c47",
"en_raw": "says difficult things"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "4968362a",
"en_raw": "That's right, respect me"
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "555fec2e",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Park Friend"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "757da207",
"en_raw": "The old man was innocent"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "2ff2ec61",
"en_raw": "Maybe the social system"
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "74ce1774",
"en_raw": "that creates people like him is the problem"
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "2afc1ddf",
"en_raw": "...or something"
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "b33508ef",
"en_raw": "True, he was Shiina's friend, living"
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "2353bd68",
"en_raw": "far beyond the realm of the"
},
{
"n": 177,
"h": "69f0a71e",
"en_raw": "meaningless thing called 'common sense'"
},
{
"n": 178,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 179,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}